@startuml training_loss_flow
!theme plain

skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif
skinparam classFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif
skinparam sequenceMessageFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif

title 训练损失计算流程（KL 散度）

participant "Network\n(LogSoftmax)" as Net
participant "BaseTrainer\n(_masked_loss)" as Trainer
participant "KLDivLoss\n(reduction=none)" as Loss
participant "SampleLoader\n(compute_masked_kl_loss)" as Loader

== 训练流程 ==

Trainer -> Net : forward(inputs)
Net --> Trainer : log_probs (N, 225)\n值域 (-∞, 0]

Trainer -> Loss : criterion(log_probs, targets)
note right of Loss : input = log_probs\n(target = probabilities)
Loss --> Trainer : per_element_kl (N, 225)

Trainer -> Trainer : loss * masks_tensor\n→ sum / mask_sum

== 纯 Python 测试辅助 ==

Loader -> Loader : compute_masked_kl_loss(\n  log_estimated, target, mask)
note right of Loader : KL(p‖q) = Σ p[i] * \n  (log(p[i]) - log_estimated[i])\n  仅 mask=1 位置

== 推理流程 ==

participant "NeuralNetworkModel\n(predict)" as Predict

Predict -> Net : forward(input_tensor)
Net --> Predict : log_probs (1, 225)
Predict -> Predict : exp(log_probs)\n→ probabilities
Predict --> Predict : return List[float]\n值域 (0,1), sum=1

@enduml
